medium targets, 1d12 to large; silver sabers do 1d8 damage regardless of
the target's size.

The blessed +7 Grayswandir does 16-30 damage against all foes.  Non-
silver-hating undead take an extra 1-4 damage due to blessing.  Werefoo
take an extra 1-20 damage due to the silver bonus.  Vampires and demons
take an extra 2-24 damage due to silver and blessing.

The blessed +7 Excalibur does 9-25 damage against small and medium foes
and 9-29 against large foes.  Undead and demons take a further 1-4
points of damage due to the blessing.

Level drain is mostly dealt with by cancellation.  Furthermore, wraiths
are feeble and vampires take Cruel Brutal Damage when hit by
Grayswandir.

